#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:116
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "09tPFK"
msgstr "1. General Information"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:118
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "P0IPF3"
msgstr "This Privacy Policy determines the procedure for collecting, storing, processing, and using the personal data of users of the \"Mandrivna Kramnytsya\" website and web application."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:123
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "kEM/gS"
msgstr "We comply with GDPR requirements and principles — transparency, security, and data minimization. By using our site, creating an account, and registering in the Hermes loyalty program, you confirm that you have read and agree to this Policy."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:130
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "vUIiDN"
msgstr "2. What data we collect"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:132
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "vbnFP8"
msgstr "We collect only the data necessary for the operation of the service and the loyalty program:"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:135
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "fZeLBC"
msgstr "Personal information (email address, date of birth, gender)"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:136
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "HAlOn1"
msgstr "Name"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:137
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "ekNWcK"
msgstr "Phone number (for registration and authorization via SMS)"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:138
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "8XHjsd"
msgstr "Transaction and accrued miles data"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:139
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "iFEl2k"
msgstr "Loyalty program status data"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:140
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "1UarQp"
msgstr "Purchase history"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:145
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "DG50CA"
msgstr "3. Use of cookies"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:147
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "4+kTCD"
msgstr "Our site uses strictly necessary cookies that ensure the proper operation of the service and authorization. We do not use advertising or analytical cookies unless you explicitly agree to them."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:152
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "6oB/MV"
msgstr "Necessary cookies ensure the operation of the site and cannot be disabled. These include session cookies (store temporary technical data — your session identifier) and a refresh token cookie used to extend your authorized session without re-entering the SMS code. This cookie is secure and inaccessible to third-party sites."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:159
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "pzGOwm"
msgstr "4. How we use your data"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:160
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "V7wUm6"
msgstr "Your personal data is used exclusively for:"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:162
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "fXS/P9"
msgstr "registration and authorization in the Hermes loyalty program;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:163
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "FSck1+"
msgstr "accrual, storage, and deduction of miles;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:164
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "yGFGA3"
msgstr "operation of the interactive country map and game bonuses;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:165
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "kro8Xk"
msgstr "placing orders in the web store;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:166
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "E0DqTQ"
msgstr "improving the quality of service and customer support."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:169
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "Dl3T8n"
msgstr "We do not transfer your data to third parties, except when necessary for the operation of technological services (SMS sending, simplified admin panel) and only via a secure protocol."

